  <title>MooseTime Data Deletion Request</title>
</head>

<body>
  <h1>MooseTime Data Deletion Request</h1>

  <p>
    MooseTime is independently developed and operated by Andy Dylan Gunawan.
  </p>

  <p>
    To request deletion of personal information associated with a feedback or
    support submission, email:
    <a href="mailto:moosetime.support@gmail.com">
      moosetime.support@gmail.com
    </a>
  </p>

  <p>
    Please include enough information to reasonably identify the submission,
    such as the email address used, approximate submission date, subject, or
    other identifying details.
  </p>

  <p>
    Information associated with an identifiable feedback or support submission
    may be deleted upon request.
  </p>

  <p>
    If feedback was submitted anonymously and does not contain information that
    can reasonably be associated with you, the developer may be unable to
    identify which submission belongs to you and therefore may be unable to
    delete that specific submission.
  </p>

  <p>
    Certain information may be retained where reasonably necessary for legal,
    security, fraud-prevention, dispute-resolution, or other lawful purposes.
    Technical logs maintained by third-party service providers may also be
    retained according to those providers' retention policies.
  </p>

  <p>
    Locally stored information, such as announcement read status and app
    preferences, can generally be removed by clearing MooseTime's app data or
    uninstalling the app.
  </p>
</body>
</html>
